        "original_id": "c854274a-4306-52a9-84c7-2c20f0641b0a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Adam Gontier, Björk, Cale Gontier\n- Bands and songs: Art of Dying, Saint Asonia, Three Days Grace, \"Crystalline\", \"Biophilia\"\n\nFacts:\n- Björk Guðmundsdóttir was born on 21 November 1965 and is an Icelandic singer, songwriter, actress, record producer, and DJ known as Björk.\n- Adam Wade Gontier was born on May 25, 1978 and is a Canadian singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Adam Gontier was the former lead singer of Three Days Grace and the lead singer of Saint Asonia.\n- Cale Gontier was the bassist of Art of Dying and is the cousin of Adam Gontier.\n- \"Crystalline\" is a song by Björk and was released as the lead single from her eighth album \"Biophilia\".",
